77
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:26,320
My name is Brett, 174, and he's speaking from Klastow.

78
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:34,320
As we embark on the school budget season, I just want to reiterate or remind that we were,

79
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:46,320
the school system was able to achieve its goals of attaining under budget status from 2025.

80
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:52,320
I congratulate the superintendent and the team for doing so.

81
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:55,320
But it does confirm that it can be done.

82
00:08:55,320 --> 00:09:02,320
When we need to tighten belts and act efficiently, we can achieve those goals.

83
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:10,320
So as we embark upon this new budget season, I think we need to keep that in mind as we're reviewing budgets.

84
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:18,320
And, you know, I think we may need to push back against the administration and the system in some cases

85
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:27,320
in order to tighten those budgets and get them in a case where we're also in alignment in the future.

86
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:37,320
If we give a slightly lower target, it's apparent that the target can be met.

87
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:42,320
So if we give a higher target, I'm sure that'll be met as well.

88
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:48,320
Which just means we will spend according to once by year.

89
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:53,320
So I appreciate everyone keeping that in mind as we move forward. Thanks.

90
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:56,320
Thank you, Ryan.

91
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,320
Okay.

